@prefix cq: <https://mustrd.org/competencyQuestion/> .
@prefix :   <https://semanticpartners.com/data/sptr-lab/> .

# CQ: "In which year was each person born?"
#
# A competency question with NO test yet. The ontology declares bio:birthYear
# and the data populates it, but nothing in queries/ asks about it — so the
# requirement is recorded here, and the CQ report shows it as a gap.
#
# Exercise: write queries/people-by-birth-year.rq, then add a must:TestSpec here
# and link it with cq:cqSpec. The gap closes.

:birthYearCQ
    a cq:CompetencyQuestion ;
    cq:question "In which year was each person born?" .
